# Test Result Formatting

When running tests and reporting results to the user:

- **Passed tests**: Present with a green indicator using 🟢 before the test name
- **Failed tests**: Present with a red indicator using 🔴 before the test name
- **Summary line**: Use **green** bold text (e.g. "**All N tests passed**") when all pass, or **red** bold text (e.g. "**N of M tests failed**") when any fail
